# Production environment overrides live on the deployed machine only.
# This file is tracked as a PLACEHOLDER — never put real credentials here.
# Set real values through systemd Environment= lines, an untracked
# .env.production on the host, or the deployment secret manager. See
# docs/SUPPORTED_ENVIRONMENT.md for the full VPS deploy checklist.
#
# KANA_ACCESS_PASSWORD removed: the password now lives as a bcrypt hash in
# SQLite (appstate.db) and bootstraps with the default "123456". Change it
# from Settings → Security on first login.
# KANA_DATA_DIR=/var/lib/kana
# AUTH_COOKIE_SECURE=true
# KANA_TRUSTED_PROXY_SECRET=<long random string shared with nginx>
